# Binary assets must never get EOL conversion. Git sniffs text-vs-binary by looking for
# NUL bytes in the first 8000; a small, base-14-font PDF has none, so git guesses "text"
# and a checkout with core.autocrlf would rewrite its LFs as CRLFs and corrupt the file.
*.pdf binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif binary
*.ico binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
